sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant UI as Next.js Dashboard
    participant API as Express API Server
    participant Gemini as GeminiService (KeyRotator)
    participant LLM as Google Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite

    Dev->>UI: Select Mode: "Chat With Repository"
    Dev->>UI: Submit inquiry regarding architecture or bug
    UI->>API: POST /api/repo/chat (repoUrl, branch, message, history)
    
    API->>Gemini: Request active model with rotation
    Gemini->>Gemini: Check active key in 6-key pool
    
    API->>LLM: invoke([SystemMessage, History, HumanMessage])
    
    alt Upstream 503 / High Demand
        LLM-->>API: 503 Service Unavailable / Spike
        API->>Gemini: rotateToNextKey("RepoChat 503")
        Gemini-->>API: Switched to next key slot
        API->>LLM: Retry invoke with backup key
    end
    
    LLM-->>API: Return markdown architectural guidance & snippets
    API-->>UI: 200 OK { success: true, reply }
    UI-->>Dev: Display assistant response with code formatting
